  m_Name: ArcadeGameTrawl
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 118
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Trawl
  Description: 'Jacks only - trawl a field of sheaves with your net. Fly your two fish through the
    field and the net between them catches every loose prism it crosses and drags it along;
    a dragged prism that hits another breaks both, and every prism you break that is not
    your colour scores. Open the fish wide for a bigger net, and sweep the packed cores.
    Shielded prisms only bounce. Higher intensities shield the cores, paint the sheaves in
    team colours and add danger spokes and creatures. First team to the target wins.'
